  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Safety Action Plan III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam has a modern food safety regulatory framework with foundations for improving food safety performance and outcomes. However, much more could be done to make it result-focused and risk-based.A Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) on Cooperation in Food Safety Management in Vietnam, signed on 10 July 2017 between the Prime Minister of Viet Nam, the World Bank Country Director of Vietnam and the Prime Minister of The Netherlands, defines the scope of the strategy by the Netherlands embassy concerning support to the Vietnamese government in the field of food safety. A series of projects are geared to realise this ambition.</narrative>
  </description>
